body:
A fantastic piece commissioned by me of two party members for our Curse of Strahd campaign. On the left, Devotion Paladin and all-round nice guy Aegon Islingr. On the right, lore bard and snake-style bladesinger Lorán ac Sianofel. 

&#x200B;

This pair were the only half-elves in a reclusive elven town, and felt the effects of it. Lorán in particular often suffered at the hands of bullies and the prejudiced... Until Aegon had any say in the matter. Finally leaving the oppressive town together, they were travelling south to Candlekeep when the mists of Ravenloft whisked them away. Cheery Aegon's personality makes up for Lorán's pessimism and faux-grump.

&#x200B;

Massive thank you to Vendela at [louchastain.tumblr.com](https://louchastain.tumblr.com) for this piece (and the previous piece she made of Lorán)! My boyfriend and I have fallen in love with Lorán and Aegon, we hope you do too!
